# Claude Code local state — scheduler lock (.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock, rewritten
# continuously) + Workflow agent worktrees. Tracking these keeps MAIN permanently dirty,
# which stalls Oryon's merge-back and triggers false contamination alarms.
.claude/
